<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and privacy" description="How to reach the ClothOff AI Safe Guide editorial team about factual corrections, source updates, privacy, or rights concerns.">
  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <p>For the fastest review, include the page URL, the exact sentence or asset involved, the reason it should be corrected or removed, and a primary source that supports the request.</p>
  <h2>Do not send sensitive images</h2>
  <p>This publication does not need your personal photos, AI prompts, identification documents, or intimate material to evaluate an editorial request. Describe the concern in text and share only the minimum information necessary.</p>
  <h2>Current contact route</h2>
  <p>Until a domain email service is configured, use the <a href="https://github.com/zanderzou/clothoffai-fun/issues" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">public repository issue tracker</a> for non-sensitive corrections. Do not post private personal data there. A dedicated privacy contact will replace this route after launch configuration is complete.</p>
</InfoPage>
